  "description": "Fuaran SSR host-integration adapter for Giraffe / ASP.NET (Phase 162). Turns \"render this Node tree as a crawlable page\" into one HttpHandler call: a typed DocumentShell (title / meta / canonical / OG+Twitter / JSON-LD / stylesheet+script refs) composed around the body fragment Renderer.Server emits, plus a deterministic strong-ETag/304 + render-cache seam (IFuaranRenderCache) for high-fan-out SEO surfaces. Giraffe is isolated to this package — the language tier and Renderer.Server stay Giraffe-free. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
